{"id":"method-domain-intersection","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>给出解析式，要求函数的定义域；可能另给输入区间。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>使原式有意义的全部输入组成的集合。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>实数范围内按原式列条件。可执行范围由结构准入限定：固定有理数系数、单变量、仿射分母与零次幂底数、根号内不超过二次且有理实根（或无实根）的固定多项式、以及固定非负整数幂；正整数幂不额外排除零底数，零次幂须保留底数非零条件。不含参数或抽象函数，超出已支持结构时不输出部分定义域。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"extract\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>找限制位置并列条件</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#extract\" aria-label=\"定位到找限制位置并列条件\">#</a></div><p>用原式位置逐条列出有意义的条件，标记每条条件的知识依据。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-expression-defined/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>提取表达式有意义的条件</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"solve\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>解每个条件</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#solve\" aria-label=\"定位到解每个条件\">#</a></div><p>解条件时保留等号与不等号的含义；基本移项和非零条件整理在本步骤完成。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-inequality-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>不等式变形与推导</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"intersect\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><h3>把全部条件与题给范围取交集</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#intersect\" aria-label=\"定位到把全部条件与题给范围取交集\">#</a></div><p>同一输入须满足所有条件；题目给出的输入范围也要纳入交集。</p></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><h3>检查原式与端点</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到检查原式与端点\">#</a></div><p>用原式复核临界值，写成端点正确的集合或区间，并检查整个集合与有意义条件等价。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#addition\">不等式的性质 · 同加减与同向相加</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#multiplication\">不等式的性质 · 乘除与方向</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#reciprocal\">不等式的性质 · 同号两数取倒数</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/integer-power/#positive-exponent\">整数幂 · 正整数次幂</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/integer-power/#zero-exponent\">整数幂 · 零次幂与底数限制</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/rational-expression/#meaning\">分式 · 有意义与值为零</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/real-order/#difference\">不等式与实数大小关系 · 作差判号</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/square-root-expression/#meaning\">二次根式 · 有意义的条件与算术平方根</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 根式与分式同时有意义</h3><p class=\"problem\">求 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\frac{\\sqrt{x-1}}{x-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.4413em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4282em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8712em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8312em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1688em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 的定义域。</p><ol><li>列条件 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-1\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-2\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord katex-vbox\"><span class=\"katex-thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"katex-fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。</span></li><li>解得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ne2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord katex-vbox\"><span class=\"katex-thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"katex-fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>，</span>取交集为 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,2)\\cup(2,+\\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</span></li></ol><p class=\"source\">函数专题第 15 题</p></article></section>"}
